   "title": "dc4ever, C#, 2003-2005",
   "snaps": [
    "dc4ever-2005"
   ],
   "text": "The second Dreamcast emulator by drk||Raziel (said \"D R K Raziel\"), written in C#. Its git dates are a 2019 reconstruction from backups (one commit per file at its mtime); the real work is 2003-2005. nullDC was partly derived from it in concept: 0.6 % of nullDC 2010 lines are shared, yet the 2005 line \"{//ToDo : Check This [26/4/05]\" still lives in nullDC 3.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "sh4_opcodes 2005 line (dc4ever)",
    "dc4ever powervr.cs"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "nullDC, 2005-2013",
   "snaps": [
    "nulldc-2010-05",
    "nulldc-2010-12",
    "nulldc-2011-09",
    "nulldc-last"
   ],
   "text": "nullDC was developed closed-source from 2005; the source went public on Google Code in 2010-05 (nullDC 1.0.x). The plugin architecture (drkPvr, nullAICA, ImgReader) and the rec_v1 SH4 recompiler are here.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "nullDC rec_v1 driver",
    "nullDC drkPvr d3dRend"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "nullDCe, the late-2008 fork",
   "snaps": [
    "nullDCe-2009",
    "nullDCe-ps2-2024"
   ],
   "text": "nullDCe forked from nullDC mainline in late 2008 for PSP / Wii / PS3 (and later PS2). The repo is a 2017 commit of a recovered archive; the latest in-source date is 2009-10. Lines present in both nullDCe 2009 and nullDC 2010 are coloured as nullDC-pre2008.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "nullDCe rec_v2 driver",
    "nullDCe rec_v2 shil",
    "nullDCe drkPvr glesRend"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "nulldc-360, 2011",
   "snaps": [
    "nulldc-360-2011",
    "nulldc-360-last"
   ],
   "text": "gligli's Xbox 360 port, imported from nullDC svn trunk of 2011-09 (93 of 203 files identical) plus a Xenos renderer and a PPC dynarec.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "nulldc-360 xenosRend"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "reicast, 2013",
