    "reicast-r6",
    "reicast-r7-rc1",
    "reicast-r8",
    "reicast-r19.07",
    "reicast-r20.04",
    "reicast-last"
   ],
   "text": "The newdc / nullDC-Android rewrite of 2012-2013, imported as one commit (1c16baeb). 39.6 % of its lines come from nullDC and 30.3 % from nullDCe. The ARM dynarec and the GLES renderer start here.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "reicast ARM dynarec",
    "reicast gles.cpp",
    "sh4_opcodes.cpp in reicast 2013"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "flycast, 2018-",
   "snaps": [
    "flycast-v1.0",
    "flycast-v2.0",
    "flycast-v2.4",
    "flycast-head"
   ],
