   ],
   "text": "nullDC4Wii imports nullDCe verbatim (2026-01); NotDC-PS3 imports nullDC4Wii (2026-09) and later carries plugs/caiqueAICA, a port of the caique-rtl AICA model.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "NotDC-PS3 caiqueAICA"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "fpgadc, 2026: the hardware re-creation",
   "snaps": [
    "minicast-import",
    "minicast-r1",
    "minicast-r6b",
    "polly2-r1",
    "polly2-r6",
    "polly2-r6b",
    "polly2-r8-develop",
    "shrike4-head",
    "caique-head",
    "wren7-head",
    "dreamcast-tests-head",
    "devtools-v3.0.0-pre"
   ],
   "text": "The FPGA branch of the lineage: DreamSTer releases r1..r6b pin polly2-rtl (PowerVR2 in SystemVerilog) and minicast (the reicast-derived ARM side). polly2-rtl r8/develop is the new bit-exact model and carries verbatim refsw3 C++ in ref_copies*.h. shrike4 (SH4), caique (AICA), wren7 (ARM7), dreamcast-tests and dreamcast-devtools are new code.",
   "bookmarks": [
    "polly2 r6b peel_core",
    "polly2 r8 ref_copies.h (refsw3 C++ copy)",
    "shrike4 v1_core",
    "caique aica_core",
    "wren7 core"
   ]
  }
